                                      "text": [
                                        "An Unanswered Seat",
                                        "Beside the signal\nlog stands a chair\nwith a mended\ncushion. The",
                                        "clerk waited there\nafter the old\nalarm, expecting a\nreply from",
                                        "anyone. She still\nuses the chair,\nbut now the desk\nhas space for a",
                                        "second person and\na duplicate log."
